{"title": "Forced Manoeuvre", "pageid": 14399, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre", "categories": ["Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\">Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)\">Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Forced_Manoeuvre.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Forced_Manoeuvre.webp/300px-Forced_Manoeuvre.webp, /w/images/5/5a/Forced_Manoeuvre.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Forced_Manoeuvre.webp/300px-Forced_Manoeuvre.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Forced_Manoeuvre.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Forced Manoeuvre</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a> fighter situational action granted after performing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Manoeuvring Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\">Manoeuvring Attack</a>. This is a free action that increases the movement speed of an ally by 4.5 m (15 ft) for a turn and prevents <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nIncrease an ally's movement speed by 4.5 m (15 ft). They don't provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/38px-Party_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/50px-Party_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Targets: Allies and not self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Party_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Targets: Allies and not self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_ForcedManeuver</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_ForcedManeuver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_ForcedManeuver\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Forced_Manoeuvre\"> Condition: Forced Manoeuvre </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre_(Condition)\" title=\"Forced Manoeuvre (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Forced Manoeuvre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Forced_Manoeuvre_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre_(Condition)\" title=\"Forced Manoeuvre (Condition)\">Forced Manoeuvre</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">Movement speed</a> increased by 4.5 m (15 ft) and doesn't provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Adept\" title=\"Martial Adept\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Adept\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Adept_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Martial_Adept_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Adept\" title=\"Martial Adept\">Martial Adept</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/38px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/50px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Manoeuvring_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\">Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/38px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/50px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Ranged)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)\">Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip says this action increases movement speed by 50%, but it actually increases it by a flat 4.5 m (15 ft) and is unaffected by any base movement speed modifiers.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060458\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.086 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3322/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42331/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14138/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1385032/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n110.65%   82.037     37 Template:Trim\n100.00%   74.140      1 -total\n 98.85%   73.289      1 Template:Feature_page\n 17.38%   12.885      7 Template:Ico